{"id": "EUVD-2026-103307", "enisaUuid": "43e64383-ebea-3a9c-af9b-26fefbe7d224", "description": "Admidio from 5.0.0 before 5.0.16 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability that allows authenticated users to export lists despite export restrictions by requesting mode=pdfl. The groups_roles_export check in modules/groups-roles/lists_show.php omits pdfl, which later runs the pdf export, letting users with list view rights download member lists as PDF files.", "datePublished": "2026-10-17T18:46:30", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T21:33:52", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/Admidio/admidio/security/advisories/GHSA-86f5-rg96-frrj", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/admidio-5.0.0-before-5.0.16-authorization-bypass-via-pdfl-mode-in-lists-show-php"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111913", "GHSA-4hmr-7mxw-r92p"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "7f6b9cce-65a5-355f-a666-25787195f55d", "product": {"name": "admidio", "vendor": {"name": "Admidio"}}, "product_version": "5.0.0 <5.0.16"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9a1bc55f-d3ad-3b88-94f0-cfdaf2dd9a01", "vendor": {"name": "Admidio"}}], "isExploited": false}